              "instruction": "atani vādanalō balaṁ lēdu. — There is no strength in his argument.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *atani vādanalō balaṁ lēdu.* — There is no strength in his argument.]"
